{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":40344,"ns":0,"title":"Semiconductor device","extract":"A semiconductor device is an electronic component that relies on the electronic properties of a semiconductor material (primarily silicon, germanium, and gallium arsenide, as well as organic semiconductors) for its function. Its conductivity lies between conductors and insulators.","description":"Electronic component that exploits the electronic properties of semiconductor materials","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}